        "body": "Discord beta release while we wait for these changes to get merged and released:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/buildkite/agent/pull/1775 Adds a config option that changes the format of the trace propagation header sent to subprocesses run from the agent during CI jobs to JSON instead of Golang-binary, which enables trace propagation and linking across process and language boundaries.\r\n- https://github.com/buildkite/agent/pull/2009 Adds an option to output job's logs in structured format in a non-temporary file for collection.\r\n- https://github.com/buildkite/agent/pull/2007 Fixes a warning from the Datadog tracing library\r\n- https://github.com/buildkite/agent/pull/1779 Allow custom tracing service name\r\n\r\nForked from 3.39.0 bc the fix in 3.39.1 breaks some hooks."
      },
